47:T6ac,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How does SmileAgrimarket work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We list farm projects from vetted operators. Investors fund a project, and the capital is held by a licensed trustee in escrow. Funds are released to the operator in stages as they reach verified milestones, and proceeds are distributed back through the same trustee after harvest."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How are funds protected?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"SmileAgrimarket never holds your money. A licensed trustee holds funds in escrow and releases them when milestone conditions are met. We record every disbursement and show it to the investors backing that project."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who can invest?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"During the private beta, access is limited and onboarded in stages. We expect to open first to Nigerian residents and members of the diaspora who complete identity verification. Availability depends on the requirements of our regulated partners."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When do returns get paid?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Proceeds are reconciled after the harvest is sold and settled, then distributed through the trustee. Timelines vary by crop and project and are shown on each listing. Investments carry risk and returns are not guaranteed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is SmileAgrimarket live?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We are in private beta. Joining the waitlist reserves early access and helps us onboard investors and operators in a controlled, compliant way. We will contact you as places open."}}]}18:["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$47"}}]
